{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026年香港小姐競選》今晚（8月30日）舉行決實，12強佳麗經過數月密集的形象訓練、海外外景拍攝及才藝特訓後，今晚在電視城角逐冠、亞、季軍及「最上鏡小姐」、「友誼小姐」等多個殊榮。</p><p>1號：袁絲珩 (Bernice Yuen)</p><p>2號：李澤欣 (Scarlett Li)</p><p>3號：李澄晴 (Chorie Li)</p><p>4號：譚雅文 (Tiffany Tan)</p><p>5號：魏欣 (Etherine Wei)</p><p>6號：盧蔚晴 (Jasmine Lo)</p><p>7號：楊媛媛 (Vera Yang)</p><p>8號：鄧匡閔 (Ada Tang)</p><p>9號：周芳姿 (Gracia Zhou)</p><p>10號：陳梓穎 (Cecilia Chan)</p><p>11號：顏懿菲 (Agnes Yan)</p><p>12號：湯家琳 (Caris Tang)</p><figure><img alt=\"GinLee勁歌熱舞。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170829369883758592940187.jpeg/PJgGFXMtnYH43zm6SmUWnA7ZW-FmBcZM-idPKswnTyo\"/><figcaption>GinLee勁歌熱舞。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"GinLee勁歌熱舞。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170829367295741952083174.jpeg/Kg8vmXLvMsTW_IrZgwm9KXXV7HE3k9vUeOI0pE7iNKQ\"/><figcaption>GinLee勁歌熱舞。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"12位佳麗出場。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170829364539953152724839.jpeg/_g94SeSf16qq7vb9M2JnQip0TRkDc8-2uEGxmY5BsZk\"/><figcaption>12位佳麗出場。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T12:39:00.265546+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":389,"images":3,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}